@StoreManagement_HostAddress = http://localhost:5020

### Sign in as a seeded manager
POST {{StoreManagement_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "manager1",
  "password": "<your SeedUsers password>"
}

### List warehouses (replace the token first)
GET {{StoreManagement_HostAddress}}/api/warehouses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

###
